+/*
+ * What a cache request with TreeScope_Children or TreeScope_Descendants
+ * returned: the nodes of the elements with their cached properties, and how
+ * the elements nest. Every element of the tree holds a reference, and
+ * creates the elements GetCachedParent and GetCachedChildren hand out from
+ * it, so the elements never refer to each other.
